@startuml
title ClearML Agent System Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "ClearML User" as User
actor "K8s Platform Operator" as Operator

package "Kubernetes Cluster" {
  node "ClearML Agent Runtime" {
    component "Kubernetes Glue\n[FR-001]" as Glue
    component "Long-lasting Service Pod Mode\n[FR-003]" as ServicePod
    component "In-Pod Experiment Runtime\n[FR-002]" as ExperimentRuntime
    component "Worker Telemetry\n[FR-004, FR-005, NFR-002]" as Telemetry
    component "Backend Service Client\n[FR-007, NFR-003]" as BackendClient
    component "Worker Configuration\n[DR-001]\nreport_period_sec=2s\nping_period_sec=30s\nlog_stdout=true\nreport_global_mem_used" as Config
  }

  component "Prepared Kubernetes Job\n[FR-001, DR-006]" as K8sJob
  component "Experiment Pod\n[FR-002]" as ExperimentPod
  component "Sibling Docker Containers\n[FR-003, C-002]" as SiblingContainers
  component "Docker Socket Mapping\n[C-002, C-005]" as DockerSocket
  component "Podman (planned)\n[C-005]" as Podman
}

package "ClearML Server / Backend" {
  component "Execution Queue\n[FR-001, DR-005]" as ExecutionQueue
  component "Backend Services\ncreate, get, get_by_id,\nget_all, get_all_ex\n[FR-007]" as BackendServices
  component "Events Service v2.5\nHistogram request/response\n[DR-002, NFR-003]" as EventsService
  component "Models Service v2.4\nModel delete request / model object\n[DR-003, DR-004, NFR-003]" as ModelsService
}

file "Kubernetes YAML Template\n[DR-006, C-003]" as YamlTemplate

User --> ExecutionQueue : submit queued jobs
Operator --> ServicePod : deploy
Operator --> Glue : deploy

YamlTemplate --> Glue : template input
ExecutionQueue --> Glue : pull jobs
Glue --> K8sJob : prepare job
K8sJob --> ExperimentPod : schedule/launch
ExperimentPod --> ExperimentRuntime : install env,\nstart & monitor process
ExperimentRuntime --> Telemetry : status data
Telemetry --> BackendClient : telemetry/RPC calls
BackendClient --> BackendServices : session-based\ncreate/get/get_by_id/\nget_all/get_all_ex
BackendClient --> EventsService : histogram\nrequest/response
BackendClient --> ModelsService : delete request /\nmodel object

Telemetry --> BackendServices : status report every\nreport_period_sec (default 2s)
Telemetry --> BackendServices : connectivity ping every\nping_period_sec (default 30s)

Config --> Telemetry : reporting & ping periods,\nmemory scope
Config --> ExperimentRuntime : log_stdout=true,\nstdout/stderr logging

ServicePod --> DockerSocket : requires
DockerSocket --> SiblingContainers : manage siblings
Podman ..> DockerSocket : planned replacement

note right of EventsService
  key selectors:
  iter, iso_time, timestamp
  samples, task
end note

note right of ModelsService
  Model object nullable fields:
  id, name, user, company, created, task
  Model delete request: model, force
end note

note bottom of BackendClient
  Requests/responses use structured service objects.
  Version compatibility: events v2.5, models v2.4.
end note

@enduml
